<%- include('../partials/header', { title }) %>
  <%# the “View only” badge rides WITH the title (school's request, 2026-09-19: “a bit more
      compact for the phone view”) — it used to take a line of its own under the title %>
  <div class="page-head pf-page-head">
    <div class="pf-head-line">
      <h1>🪪 My Profile</h1>
      <span class="badge blue">🔒 View only</span>
    </div>
    <p>Your own record at the school — <b>exactly what the office has set for you</b>.</p>
  </div>

  <%#
    The cards themselves live in ONE partial, because the teacher's dashboard shows the very
    same block under its title (school's request, 2026-09-18) — one file, so the two can never
    drift apart. `withSections` adds the section tiles, which only this page prints: the
    dashboard already carries the same list as tappable tiles in its own panel.
  %>
  <%- include('../partials/teacher_profile_cards', { withSections: true }) %>
<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
